{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3vsMrTuAkAAo68tp8N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, weathered by countless seasons. A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber. The iron bands groan. The wood grain shifts and spirals. Light bleeds through the widening crack as the door swings slowly inward, revealing:*\n\nA corridor of warm golden light stretching endlessly forward, the air thick with the scent of old books and rain on stone. Each step you might take would echo twice — once beneath your feet, once somewhere far ahead, as if the corridor remembers your footsteps before you make them.\n\n*The door holds itself open. Waiting.*\n\n*It will not wait forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":173,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}